@startuml
title C4 Level 4 - Python Code Overview
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false

class GraphData <<conceptual>> {
    graph: dictionary
}

class SearchAlgorithms <<module>> {
    bfs(g, start, goal)
    dfs(g, start, goal)
}

class Profiling <<module>> {
    measure(function, runs)
}

class SearchResult <<conceptual>> {
    path
    expanded_nodes
}

GraphData --> SearchAlgorithms : Graph input
SearchAlgorithms --> SearchResult : Path and node count
Profiling --> SearchAlgorithms : Repeated execution

@enduml